            <p>
                <strong>5. </strong>
                This question has two parts. Answer Part A and then Part B.
            </p>
            <p>
                <strong>Part A </strong>
                In paragraph 6, what is the meaning of the word
                <span class="underline">migrated</span>
                ?
            </p>
            <qti-choice-interaction response-identifier="RESPONSE_1" shuffle="false" max-choices="1" min-choices="1">
                <qti-simple-choice identifier="X91137-t01as01asi005asic001">
                    <strong>A. </strong>
                    looked toward someone or something
                </qti-simple-choice>
                <qti-simple-choice identifier="X91137-t01as01asi005asic002">
                    <strong>B. </strong>
                    found hope in a different place
                </qti-simple-choice>
                <qti-simple-choice identifier="X91137-t01as01asi005asic003">
                    <strong>C. </strong>
                    quit work and applied for a new job
                </qti-simple-choice>
                <qti-simple-choice identifier="X91137-t01as01asi005asic004">
                    <strong>D. </strong>
                    moved from one region to another
                </qti-simple-choice>
            </qti-choice-interaction>
            <p>
                <strong>Part B </strong>
                Which
                <strong>two</strong>
                sentences in paragraph 6 give clues to the meaning of
                <span class="underline">migrated</span>
                ?
            </p>
            <qti-choice-interaction response-identifier="RESPONSE_2" shuffle="false" max-choices="2" min-choices="1">
                <qti-simple-choice identifier="X91137-t01as01asi005asic005">
                    <strong>A. </strong>
                    &quot;During the years of drought, many farmers in the Dust Bowl felt hopeless.&quot;
                </qti-simple-choice>
                <qti-simple-choice identifier="X91137-t01as01asi005asic006">
                    <strong>B. </strong>
                    &quot;Many tried to find farm work in California.&quot;
                </qti-simple-choice>
                <qti-simple-choice identifier="X91137-t01as01asi005asic007">
                    <strong>C. </strong>
                    &quot;They moved there in the hopes of a better life.&quot;
                </qti-simple-choice>
                <qti-simple-choice identifier="X91137-t01as01asi005asic008">
                    <strong>D. </strong>
                    &quot;The government set up programs to help farmers.&quot;
                </qti-simple-choice>
                <qti-simple-choice identifier="X91137-t01as01asi005asic009">
                    <strong>E. </strong>
                    &quot;The farmers learned how to take care of the soil and make it productive again.&quot;
                </qti-simple-choice>
